flowchart LR
  Fork[Untrusted fork PR] -->|read-only| CI[Static GitHub CI]
  Maintainer[Approved maintainer] --> Env[Protected environment]
  Env -->|OIDC, short-lived| WIF[Google WIF]
  WIF --> Plan[Plan service account]
  WIF --> Apply[Apply service account]
  Apply --> GCP[GCP control plane]
  GCP --> Nodes[Private GKE nodes]
  Nodes --> Metadata[GKE metadata server]
  Metadata --> APIID[API Google service account]
  Metadata --> WorkerID[Worker Google service account]
  Client[Internet client] --> Armor[Cloud Armor]
  Armor --> Gateway[GKE Gateway]
  Gateway --> Pod[Restricted Pod]
  Pod --> GoogleAPI[Private Google API ranges]
